## LaTeX build artefacts (adapted from the JKU template's shipped .gitignore)
*.aux
*.bbl
*.blg
*.bcf
*.cut
*.fdb_latexmk
*.fls
*.glo
*.gls
*.idx
*.ilg
*.ind
*.log
*.lof
*.lot
*.nav
*.out
*.run.xml
*.snm
*.synctex.gz*
*.synctex(busy)
*.thm
*.toc
*.vrb
*.xdv
.~*#
*~

## Compiled PDFs (skeleton compile output; commit the final PDF only when
## intentionally releasing a version)
/main-thesis.pdf
/main-*.pdf

## Guard against accidental inclusion of dataset / result / checkpoint / audio
## artefacts inside the thesis directory. These paths should never appear here
## in the first place -- the thesis distributes source, LaTeX, and figure PDFs
## only -- but the guard is cheap and defends against a stray copy-paste.
data/
results/
checkpoints/
manifest*.jsonl
*.wav
*.flac
*.mp3
*.ogg

## Figure-generation intermediates (if any)
figures/*.svg
figures/*.tmp
